    "body": "Error 60 is an SSL certificate problem. There are a lot of potential reasons this could happen.\r\n\r\nThe simplest one I'd start by testing is seeing if you have `ca-certificates` installed. If no, install them and try again.\r\n\r\nIf that still doesn't work, try running `curl --show-error --no-progress-meter --location --output /tmp/tmp.53MEHr9GTf.tar.gz https://github.com/starship/starship/releases/latest/download/starship-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz` and putting the output here.",
